<title>USA: Peoples Telephone names officer.</title>
<headline>Peoples Telephone names officer.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peoples Telephone Co Inc said Wednesday it had hired William Baum as chief financial officer and senior vice president of the company.</p>
<p>Peoples, a provider of public pay telephone services, said in a statement that Baum will succeed Bonnie Biumi, who is leaving the company &quot;to pursue other opportunities&quot;.</p>
<p>Baum worked as vice president and chief financial officer at Ryder Integrated Logistics of Ryder System Inc, it said.</p>
